message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "GHG Inventory Toolkit"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-31
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An open-source greenhouse gas inventory calculator for organisations in India.
  Fill an Excel template, upload it, and get Scope 1, 2 and 3 results with drill-down
  and client-ready exports. Calculations run in the browser.
